Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6ec63cd9e90c4804040209c68df28df","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JUSTUSTWO&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;A few BDW brides have bought travel cups &amp;amp; then personalized them with waterproof labels &amp;amp; markers.\n They came out really cute. I would do a few as tests to see how well they hold up before you buy them in large quantities.\n \n Here&#039;s a thread that I found that may give you some ideas:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I knew someone on here had done this before so I went looking for the thread &amp;amp; found it.\n This thread has the pics of the mugs:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n And this one tells how she did it &amp;amp; what materials she used:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Morgan did these as well. Take a look at her planning thread:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;You are a sweetie!! Thank you for doing that :) Everyone&#039;s OOT Bag&#039;s look great and I picked up a few more ideas from those threads!! Now, I hope I have enough room in my suitcases Haha!!\n \n Quick question: Did anyone buy bottles of Advil, Motrin, Pepto Pills and put them in personalized pill boxes or anything? Do you think people will use them if they are opened like that?","Attachments":[],"Id":570966,"PostDate":1232810382,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">A few BDW brides have bought travel cups & then personalized them with waterproof labels & markers.<br \/> They came out really cute. I would do a few as tests to see how well they hold up before you buy them in large quantities.<br \/> <br \/> Here's a thread that I found that may give you some ideas:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t33350' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t33350<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I knew someone on here had done this before so I went looking for the thread & found it.<br \/> This thread has the pics of the mugs:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13580' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t13580<\/a><br \/> <br \/> And this one tells how she did it & what materials she used:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t13574' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t13574<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Morgan did these as well. Take a look at her planning thread:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21764' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t21764<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>You are a sweetie!! Thank you for doing that <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Everyone's OOT Bag's look great and I picked up a few more ideas from those threads!! Now, I hope I have enough room in my suitcases Haha!!<br \/> <br \/> Quick question: Did anyone buy bottles of Advil, Motrin, Pepto Pills and put them in personalized pill boxes or anything? Do you think people will use them if they are opened like that?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;31;47\/st\/20080813\/n\/London+April\/dt\/-2\/k\/8ad7\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/8ad7\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cindydarkhall@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222664910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212016.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cindy&London","Id":212016,"Name":"Cindy&London","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"631ae7573de03fbb294c42637b01ad25","RawContent":"Thanks for all the links JUSTUSTWO!! You and this entire site are full of great information and help!!","Attachments":[],"Id":570975,"PostDate":1232810578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all the links JUSTUSTWO!! You and this entire site are full of great information and help!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/good-times.webshots.com\/album\/573617153iUHYaT\"><strong>Our Wedding Day Slideshow<\/strong><\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46627\"><strong>Moon Palace Resort \/ Wedding Review<\/strong><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t37779\">OOT Bags<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t40584\">Beach Towels<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43663#post825781\">Wedding Tanks\/Tees<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hatla@arlut.utexas.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231935573,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213940.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinaM2b","Id":213940,"Name":"TinaM2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffc6485777485af87216b794eb0562f7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JUSTUSTWO&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Basically I had everyone&#039;s email address so I just sent out 1 email to everyone asking for their size in t-shirts &amp;amp; flip flops. I mean it may have taken the surprise out of what they would be getting but I really wanted to make sure that I had the correct sizes. It worked very well but then I only had 30 guests to do this for, not 70! But I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll have a problem. \n \n If you do go this route, just make sure that the store that you are buying them from uses sizes in numbers as opposed to Small, Medium, Large. You don&#039;t want to ask your guest for sizes in #&#039;s only to find that the store has them in S,M,L! I had to learn this the hard way! LOL\n And also ask that they respond by a certain date so that you&#039;re prepared &amp;amp; only have to make 1 trip.\n \n I also made sure to do this when the flip flops were on sale for 2 for $5 and the store manager gave me an extra discount since I bought so many.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;THANKS!!! Great advice!!! I think that is what I&#039;ll try to do..hopefully everyone will cooperate!:) \n Someone on here posted a site for THE CUTEST personalized flip flops...I really want to put them in the OOT bag!!! Now, I think I might! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":571181,"PostDate":1232827554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Basically I had everyone's email address so I just sent out 1 email to everyone asking for their size in t-shirts & flip flops. I mean it may have taken the surprise out of what they would be getting but I really wanted to make sure that I had the correct sizes. It worked very well but then I only had 30 guests to do this for, not 70! But I don't think you'll have a problem. <br \/> <br \/> If you do go this route, just make sure that the store that you are buying them from uses sizes in numbers as opposed to Small, Medium, Large. You don't want to ask your guest for sizes in #'s only to find that the store has them in S,M,L! I had to learn this the hard way! LOL<br \/> And also ask that they respond by a certain date so that you're prepared & only have to make 1 trip.<br \/> <br \/> I also made sure to do this when the flip flops were on sale for 2 for $5 and the store manager gave me an extra discount since I bought so many.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>THANKS!!! Great advice!!! I think that is what I'll try to do..hopefully everyone will cooperate!<img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> Someone on here posted a site for THE CUTEST personalized flip flops...I really want to put them in the OOT bag!!! Now, I think I might! <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rweidelman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201910461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208442.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rhonda","Id":208442,"Name":"Rhonda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0561138e69e5a4b6f01a71dcef6b02b","RawContent":"Thanks! Great post - i need to start putting mine together and this will help! I was going to buy sunscreen but i guess everyone will bring there own! LOL!","Attachments":[],"Id":571213,"PostDate":1232830224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks! Great post - i need to start putting mine together and this will help! I was going to buy sunscreen but i guess everyone will bring there own! LOL!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>**Shannon** 40 people BOOKED! (but only 23 made it b\/c of the Swine flu Pandemic )<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i300.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn29\/Kriswim01\/PlayadelCarmenWedding352.jpg\">http:\/\/i300.photobucket.com\/albums\/n...Wedding352.jpg<\/a><br><strong>My Wedding Review:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/royal-gran-porto-pdc-loong-review-w-pics-43618\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...-w-pics-43618\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannonkrista@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201702199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208409.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kriswim","Id":208409,"Name":"Kriswim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fffc606f69d1d367777250967478353","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JUSTUSTWO&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Here are a few pics that I found from my planning thread. I did get personalized mugs. I see that the pics are kinda fuzzy so I&#039;ll include the link to the album on Shutterfly:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec4466200fc3100000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Here&#039;s just the OOT bag which came out way better than the pic shows:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446897a3d9600000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n Here&#039;s the personalized travel mug:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446d7733db000000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n And a picture of the first aid kit (which had the band aids, meds, chapstick &amp;amp; hand wipe packets) &amp;amp; personalized pens that we ordered as well (ignore the ceremony fans). I also must say that the personalized pens were a hit too.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec44600a5fca500000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;JUSTUSTWO,\n \n Which website or company did you order your travel mugs from?","Attachments":[],"Id":571258,"PostDate":1232834019,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here are a few pics that I found from my planning thread. I did get personalized mugs. I see that the pics are kinda fuzzy so I'll include the link to the album on Shutterfly:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec4466200fc3100000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D720\/ry%3D480\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Here's just the OOT bag which came out way better than the pic shows:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446897a3d9600000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> Here's the personalized travel mug:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec446d7733db000000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> And a picture of the first aid kit (which had the band aids, meds, chapstick & hand wipe packets) & personalized pens that we ordered as well (ignore the ceremony fans). I also must say that the personalized pens were a hit too.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/media\/47b8db28b3127ccec44600a5fca500000010O02EbtXDlsyZA9vPgo\/cC\/f%3D0\/ps%3D50\/r%3D0\/rx%3D550\/ry%3D400\/\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>JUSTUSTWO,<br \/> <br \/> Which website or company did you order your travel mugs from?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>47 people joined us in Jamaica!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091114\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/4ed2\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...4ed2\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bls62.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...nde2\/bls62.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aliciaandrob2009@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1210698038,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209388.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":81,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jamaicabride09","Id":209388,"Name":"jamaicabride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d29d800c5a4ec482ad909d72e1bf24bd","RawContent":"I really have to ask, cuz it&#039;s really bugging me.. What does OOT stand for?? I get the idea of it, but can&#039;t figure out what it stands for..haha","Attachments":[],"Id":571266,"PostDate":1232834483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I really have to ask, cuz it's really bugging me.. What does OOT stand for?? I get the idea of it, but can't figure out what it stands for..haha\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daniella_patterson82@Hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220575765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211576.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DaniellaP","Id":211576,"Name":"DaniellaP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b2e15f1adf9c99682129efa647eaee3","RawContent":"Thanks for the info about the bags. I was actually just trying to figure that out. Oriental Trading has some personalized paper gift bags so I&#039;m wondering if that might be a better idea that my original plan of the canvas tote bags...","Atta