lspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I used Discount mugs. Here's their site & the mug that I got:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/us\/index.php?c=2&p=85' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cheap promotional Travel Mug - Custom Printed Personalized Plastic Economy Tumbler(ST9000) from DiscountMugs.<\/a><br \/> <br \/> They were easy to work with & I have no complaints.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table><\/div> <br \/> I just found out that there was a 10% off of everything promo code for Discount mugs, but it ended yesterday!<br \/> <br \/> I guess I'll keep checking. Thanks for the tip!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberht@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231959120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213957.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":202,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"InspiredBride","Id":213957,"Name":"InspiredBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46a4c3e66e5cd664ec44641a783f6604","RawContent":"This is a great thread!! Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":571547,"PostDate":1232885320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a great thread!! Thanks so much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shannon<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon\">http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/RichandShannon<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannonettaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219846373,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211413.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunsetbride1","Id":211413,"Name":"sunsetbride1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d48090f65cda69230905bcc2f88f250f","RawContent":"I got personalized mugs for my oot bags! They are beer steins with our logo on them. They turned out great! They did a customized order of only 50 instead of the usual 100. I don&#039;t know how to post the link but if you look under the oot stuff and look for the thread personalized mugs. On there are links and pictures for any of you that might want to check out that site.","Attachments":[],"Id":571580,"PostDate":1232887286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got personalized mugs for my oot bags! They are beer steins with our logo on them. They turned out great! They did a customized order of only 50 instead of the usual 100. I don't know how to post the link but if you look under the oot stuff and look for the thread personalized mugs. On there are links and pictures for any of you that might want to check out that site.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny_ferball@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215227213,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210331.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennyatk","Id":210331,"Name":"jennyatk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"235a309a273edded7a131961147faebf","RawContent":"&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Hits&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n -Bubba Mugs (These were the biggest hit and used by all our guests everyday)\n -Cards\n -Bite sized chocolates for snacks\n -First Aid Kits (Bandaids and Meds)\n -Ugly green material (This was handed out before we left and was tied onto everyones suitcases. Then at the airport, a few people went over and started grabbing everones suitcases just by seeing the ugly green material)\n -Bath puff (Since wash cloths are a rare commodity in the Dominican, everyone enjoyed their body puff thingy)\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Misses&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n -Bath bombs (I made these and didn&#039;t even hand them out to most people as I forgot at first and then the humidity down there got into them and they didn&#039;t fizz all that great anymore. My daughter and my sister used most of them up)","Attachments":[],"Id":571581,"PostDate":1232887527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <strong><u>Hits<\/u><\/strong><br \/> -Bubba Mugs (These were the biggest hit and used by all our guests everyday)<br \/> -Cards<br \/> -Bite sized chocolates for snacks<br \/> -First Aid Kits (Bandaids and Meds)<br \/> -Ugly green material (This was handed out before we left and was tied onto everyones suitcases. Then at the airport, a few people went over and started grabbing everones suitcases just by seeing the ugly green material)<br \/> -Bath puff (Since wash cloths are a rare commodity in the Dominican, everyone enjoyed their body puff thingy)<br \/> <br \/> <strong><u>Misses<\/u><\/strong><br \/> -Bath bombs (I made these and didn't even hand them out to most people as I forgot at first and then the humidity down there got into them and they didn't fizz all that great anymore. My daughter and my sister used most of them up)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Pro%20wedding%20pics\/DSC_0038-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r...DSC_0038-1.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r51\/ethrondson\/Pro%20wedding%20pics\/DSC_0463-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i141.photobucket.com\/albums\/r...DSC_0463-1.jpg<\/a><br><span>My wedding review of the Grand Palladium Palace, Punta Cana, Dominican Republic<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35125\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35125<\/a><br><br><span>Our Professional Wedding and TTD Pictures by Photo Souvenir<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35430\">http:...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ethrondson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208386687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209120.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EricaG","Id":209120,"Name":"EricaG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ede794fb9a005ef62a8ce300261538bb","RawContent":"Thanks for sharing the info! It makes planning these a little easier!","Attachments":[],"Id":571592,"PostDate":1232888439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for sharing the info! It makes planning these a little easier!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msjcastillo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231081691,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213573.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"msjcastillo","Id":213573,"Name":"msjcastillo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1233,"TotalPages":124,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":1230},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
