{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17619be4534ddaa39c1f619757dd9af1","RawContent":"Thanks for the &amp;quot;heads&amp;quot; up ladies it will save a few of us from overdoing it!!","Attachments":[],"Id":571648,"PostDate":1232892412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the \"heads\" up ladies it will save a few of us from overdoing it!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"car1969@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231610686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213818.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"car1969","Id":213818,"Name":"car1969","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81b48bcc755bfcc8029931af9ecd249c","RawContent":"We went to the $ store yesterday and loaded up on puzzle books ($1), hand sanititizer (3\/$1 - .33), mini notepads (4\/$1 - .25), tissue packets (8\/$1 - .13) and sunscreen ($1). I have heard on some other threads that sunscreen in the summer weddings can really be appreciated if someone forgot or left theirs at the pool. Sunscreen in Mexico cost $26\/bottle. A friend just came back and had to buy some while she was there. Since it was only a $1, I figured it was worth having in there. Many of my guests are going for a week.\n \n I am definitely buying personalized mugs to add in too! Thanks for all the tips.","Attachments":[],"Id":571677,"PostDate":1232893137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We went to the $ store yesterday and loaded up on puzzle books ($1), hand sanititizer (3\/$1 - .33), mini notepads (4\/$1 - .25), tissue packets (8\/$1 - .13) and sunscreen ($1). I have heard on some other threads that sunscreen in the summer weddings can really be appreciated if someone forgot or left theirs at the pool. Sunscreen in Mexico cost $26\/bottle. A friend just came back and had to buy some while she was there. Since it was only a $1, I figured it was worth having in there. Many of my guests are going for a week.<br \/> <br \/> I am definitely buying personalized mugs to add in too! Thanks for all the tips.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/good-times.webshots.com\/album\/573617153iUHYaT\"><strong>Our Wedding Day Slideshow<\/strong><\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46627\"><strong>Moon Palace Resort \/ Wedding Review<\/strong><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t37779\">OOT Bags<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t40584\">Beach Towels<\/a><span> - - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43663#post825781\">Wedding Tanks\/Tees<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hatla@arlut.utexas.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231935573,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213940.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinaM2b","Id":213940,"Name":"TinaM2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"534446fad1a1bbd0dab4682d09adc858","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KLC77&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I actually wish I did some sort of cup or mug. I think it would&#039;ve been great for drinks at the bar and my guests would&#039;ve really liked them.\n \n \n \n We ended up just using aqua paper gift bags that I bought at Michael&#039;s for 37 cents each and stuck a logo sticker on the front. They were really easy to pack and then people wouldn&#039;t feel badly about throwing them out.\n \n \n \n I bought immodium caplets and pepto tablets. The way they are packaged made it easy to separate them out but still have them be in their original packaging, if that makes sense. So, the pills weren&#039;t loose. I just wrote out the directions on a clear label and stuck them to business cards I had leftover from a Vista print order from other wedding stuff. That way everyone had the directions too.\n \n \n \n \n Ha, I know! I should&#039;ve known better. lol&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Kelly, \n \n Thanks! That makes perfect sense!! I will definately use that idea. Now to find tylenol or something of the sort. Thank you so much :)","Attachments":[],"Id":571708,"PostDate":1232894045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KLC77<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I actually wish I did some sort of cup or mug. I think it would've been great for drinks at the bar and my guests would've really liked them.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> We ended up just using aqua paper gift bags that I bought at Michael's for 37 cents each and stuck a logo sticker on the front. They were really easy to pack and then people wouldn't feel badly about throwing them out.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I bought immodium caplets and pepto tablets. The way they are packaged made it easy to separate them out but still have them be in their original packaging, if that makes sense. So, the pills weren't loose. I just wrote out the directions on a clear label and stuck them to business cards I had leftover from a Vista print order from other wedding stuff. That way everyone had the directions too.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Ha, I know! I should've known better. lol<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Kelly, <br \/> <br \/> Thanks! That makes perfect sense!! I will definately use that idea. Now to find tylenol or something of the sort. Thank you so much <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;31;47\/st\/20080813\/n\/London+April\/dt\/-2\/k\/8ad7\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/8ad7\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cindydarkhall@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222664910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212016.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cindy&London","Id":212016,"Name":"Cindy&London","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"699b7b5874cf347dd13d42065dd46276","RawContent":"Thanks for the heads up!","Attachments":[],"Id":571722,"PostDate":1232895097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the heads up!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aprilsabride@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211090702,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209459.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissLucky7Bride","Id":209459,"Name":"MissLucky7Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df857bd048879967b0cc149e2dde87f2","RawContent":"for those looking for travel mugs here is what I have complied: Staples, BJs\/Sams wholesale clubs, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/\"&gt;Minimus - For All Your Travel Size Item Needs&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/industrial\/tablets1.htm\"&gt;First Aid Tablets &amp;amp; First Aid Medications...Wholesale to the Public Online!&lt;\/a&gt; the last website someone just mentioned in this forum and I wrote an email to my friend who is a pharmacist to check it out looks like good deals on generics but I wouldn&#039;t want people to get ripped off so I&#039;ll post her response when I get it.","Attachments":[],"Id":571765,"PostDate":1232899212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                for those looking for travel mugs here is what I have complied: Staples, BJs\/Sams wholesale clubs, <a href='http:\/\/www.minimus.biz\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Minimus - For All Your Travel Size Item Needs<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/www.first-aid-product.com\/industrial\/tablets1.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>First Aid Tablets & First Aid Medications...Wholesale to the Public Online!<\/a> the last website someone just mentioned in this forum and I wrote an email to my friend who is a pharmacist to check it out looks like good deals on generics but I wouldn't want people to get ripped off so I'll post her response when I get it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i348.photobucket.com\/albums\/q351\/merocket59\/logo4small.png\">http:\/\/i348.photobucket.com\/albums\/q...logo4small.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"merocket59@aol.com","IpAddress":"75.69.58.113","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1211560056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209559.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"merocket59","Id":209559,"Name":"merocket59","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0