ic.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232710171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214237.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jojoboone1109","Id":214237,"Name":"jojoboone1109","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81c61108dbaf34c9facc62bbb490afed","RawContent":"I know there&#039;s a site called Zazzle that will do it, but it seems kind of expensive to me (I think it was like $8 a page).","Attachments":[],"Id":572546,"PostDate":1232980738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know there's a site called Zazzle that will do it, but it seems kind of expensive to me (I think it was like $8 a page).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberht@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231959120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213957.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":202,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"InspiredBride","Id":213957,"Name":"InspiredBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6bba32f1821451cb16fb231c3ebd35e","RawContent":"Hits..\n Totes ($dollar store Canadian flags on them) most used them daily\n Travel mugs ($ store) bought sharpie poster paint and put Puerto Plata and their names on it. They scrathced off by the end of the week, but everyone used these!\n Band Aids - blisters like crazy for our group\n Conversion charts we laminated a chart of the exchange rate as of a few days before we left with Domincan peso to American on one side and USD to CDN on the other\n Odour eliminator -people sprayed rooms, clothes...\n Face cloths - Norwex face cloths can take off make up with only water and they rarely give you face cloths down there.\n Welcome booklet with guest pics and names. Helped everyone feel part of the group.\n Misses\n Beach balls\/footballs - no one used them they all just veggied out.\n Sewing kits - no one repoted needing it, but I have been on vacation and a bathing suit strap needed repair and I didn&#039;t have anything, so still glad I put it in (so cheap.)\n lip balm - never saw anyone use and we didn&#039;t touch it.\n post its - not many used.","Attachments":[],"Id":572565,"PostDate":1232981761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hits..<br \/> Totes ($dollar store Canadian flags on them) most used them daily<br \/> Travel mugs ($ store) bought sharpie poster paint and put Puerto Plata and their names on it. They scrathced off by the end of the week, but everyone used these!<br \/> Band Aids - blisters like crazy for our group<br \/> Conversion charts we laminated a chart of the exchange rate as of a few days before we left with Domincan peso to American on one side and USD to CDN on the other<br \/> Odour eliminator -people sprayed rooms, clothes...<br \/> Face cloths - Norwex face cloths can take off make up with only water and they rarely give you face cloths down there.<br \/> Welcome booklet with guest pics and names. Helped everyone feel part of the group.<br \/> Misses<br \/> Beach balls\/footballs - no one used them they all just veggied out.<br \/> Sewing kits - no one repoted needing it, but I have been on vacation and a bathing suit strap needed repair and I didn't have anything, so still glad I put it in (so cheap.)<br \/> lip balm - never saw anyone use and we didn't touch it.<br \/> post its - not many used.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Like our first kiss all over again<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saraece@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1168196840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saraece","Id":207034,"Name":"saraece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"617e0672bdcb56b14183c2ff3c910f49","RawContent":"Excellent ladies! Keep it coming.....:)","Attachments":[],"Id":572574,"PostDate":1232982268,"PostContent":"            <html