\/\">My pro Pictures from Erick Rodriguez<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/cancunweddingvideo.com\/wedding\/beth_jay\/\">Our Wedding Video from Cancun Wedding Video<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/JicQm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/JicQm4\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bethkatz12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1213089226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209860.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":73,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Blkatz","Id":209860,"Name":"Blkatz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df41fceff280ecaeb746218b9f6ccad1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jojoboone1109&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;great thread, good for us newbies.. never thought about the first aid kit! does anyone know where you can get custom stickers to stick on the oot bags?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I printed mine at Zazzle. It was 4.95 a page~ you get 20 stickers per page if you get the small ones and 6 stickers per page if you get the large ones. I recommend the large ones. The small ones would be good if they only have an image and not writing as the writing comes out very small. The large ones came out great.","Attachments":[],"Id":572629,"PostDate":1232984837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jojoboone1109<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">great thread, good for us newbies.. never thought about the first aid kit! does anyone know where you can get custom stickers to stick on the oot bags?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I printed mine at Zazzle. It was 4.95 a page~ you get 20 stickers per page if you get the small ones and 6 stickers per page if you get the large ones. I recommend the large ones. The small ones would be good if they only have an image and not writing as the writing comes out very small. The large ones came out great.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>~Kelly<\/strong><br><br><strong>Our Awesome Wedding Pics:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kcoby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211247595,"Photo":