perron","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4560014058d7cf185d45badc4176eb86","RawContent":"I agree with everyone; knowing what worked well and not so well in the OOT bags is very helpful. Being new to the forum, I have only just started to think of these things, but I have debated as to which kind of OOT bag will be most useful for guests so as to not be wasteful (tote or durable paper bag). I also think creating a DIY Spanish translation book\/handout will be something we will attempt. I&#039;m looking forward to hearing more from the veterans on this forum.","Attachments":[],"Id":582440,"PostDate":1233766345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree with everyone; knowing what worked well and not so well in the OOT bags is very helpful. Being new to the forum, I have only just started to think of these things, but I have debated as to which kind of OOT bag will be most useful for guests so as to not be wasteful (tote or durable paper bag). I also think creating a DIY Spanish translation book\/handout will be something we will attempt. I'm looking forward to hearing more from the veterans on this forum.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BoAdrienne@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231851064,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213909.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boven","Id":213909,"Name":"boven","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b65b11cc49c0494d00fa15ef562a8b87","RawContent":"i was going to copy this and make it prettier to toss into mine for a spanish english thing\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.travelyucatan.com\/info-10.htm\"&gt;Basic Travel Spanish Mexico : TravelYucatan.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n and i found this which i&#039;m going to make a little card out of too\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.oanda.com\/converter\/classic\"&gt;Currency Converter for 164 Currencies&lt;\/a&gt;\n pick your currencies, then go &#039;convert now&#039;, then on the right is a &#039;travellers cheatsheet&#039;. voila!\n but do it closer to your date cuz the currency rate is based on what date you do it","Attachments":[],"Id":583386,"PostDate":1233837570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i was going to copy this and make it prettier to toss into mine for a spanish english thing<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.travelyucatan.com\/info-10.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Basic Travel Spanish Mexico : TravelYucatan.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> and i found this which i'm going to make a little card out of too<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.oanda.com\/converter\/classic' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Currency Converter for 164 Currencies<\/a><br \/> pick your currencies, then go 'convert now', then on the right is a 'travellers cheatsheet'. voila!<br \/> but do it closer to your date cuz the currency rate is based on what date you do it\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>nyssa & joel<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/calchiks-punta-cana-gran-bahia-prinicipe-bavaro-wedding-review-long-pics-45227\/\"><strong>Our Punta Cana wedding review<\/strong><\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/s384.photobucket.com\/albums\/oo290\/njadem\/wedding\/photo%20book\/?albumview=slideshow\"><strong>Our photo book<\/strong><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"joelnyssa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1214492111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210179.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calchik","Id":210179,"Name":"calchik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":29980,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae25055765adf991444164a9572dbeb3","RawContent":"Great currency info - thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":583482,"PostDate":1233841276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                